{"id":"a5bf1c63a4amr9yojrkqkc1sw","title":"极狐全系车型推出换电版，宁德时代换电站目标6000座","originalTitle":"宁德时代等来一个敢押全系的盟友","summary":"极狐宣布为贝塔、阿尔法和问道三大系列全系车型推出换电版，其中贝塔S3和T1换电版月租399-599元。极狐10月销量环比增长22.3%，前10个月累计销量达16.18万辆。宁德时代计划2027年建成6000座换电站，已扩展至200座城市，并计划沿高速布局1000座。双方通过车企渠道和地方国资合作降低建站成本。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"华尔街见闻"},"links":{"original":"https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3785945"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-14T10:40:30.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-14T10:56:23.898Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-14T10:56:23.898Z","category":"stock-asia-tech","tags":["财报","产品上线"],"score":51,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"earnings","name":"财报"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}